# Only needed for LIVE forecasts and for refreshing the dataset.
# The demo, the notebooks and the pre-trained model all run without it.
#
# 1. Register (free) at https://transparency.entsoe.eu
# 2. Ask for "Restful API access" (email transparency@entsoe.eu), then
#    generate a security token under My Account Settings.
# 3. cp .env.example .env   and paste the token below.
ENTSOE_API_KEY=your_entsoe_security_token_here
